title: "AgentTelemetry: A Fault Detection Benchmark and Toolkit for LLM Agent Observability"
abstract: "OpenTelemetry-based observability for AI agent systems. Provides 9 agent-specific span kinds, 7 framework adapters, privacy controls, and analysis tools for fault detection in autonomous agents."
